<office:body><office:text><text:tracked-changes><text:changed-region text:id="ct1"><text:deletion><office:change-info><dc:creator>Ann Editor</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-01-01T10:00:00</dc:date></office:change-info><text:p>gone </text:p></text:deletion></text:changed-region><text:changed-region text:id="ct2"><text:insertion><office:change-info><dc:creator>Ann Editor</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-01-01T10:00:00</dc:date></office:change-info></text:insertion></text:changed-region></text:tracked-changes><text:sequence-decls><text:sequence-decl text:display-outline-level="0" text:name="Illustration"/></text:sequence-decls>
<text:h text:outline-level="1">Interview with Pat</text:h><text:p>Q:<text:tab/>Why did you leave?<text:line-break/>Pat: Because    the clinic was far.<text:note text:id="ftn1" text:note-class="footnote"><text:note-citation>1</text:note-citation><text:note-body><text:p>The clinic in town.</text:p></text:note-body></text:note> We <text:change text:change-id="ct1"/>moved <text:change-start text:change-id="ct2"/>quickly<text:change-end text:change-id="ct2"/>.</text:p><text:p><office:annotation><dc:creator>Ann Editor</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-01-01T10:00:00</dc:date><text:p>Check the date.</text:p></office:annotation>It was in 2019<office:annotation-end/> and an endnote<text:note text:id="edn1" text:note-class="endnote"><text:note-citation>i</text:note-citation><text:note-body><text:p>End note text.</text:p></text:note-body></text:note> here.</text:p><text:p>Outer words<draw:frame draw:style-name="fr1" draw:name="Frame1" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="5cm"><draw:text-box><text:p>In a box</text:p></draw:text-box></draw:frame> after the box.</text:p><table:table table:name="Table1"><table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="2"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Name:</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Ana</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table><text:p>Caf&#233; well<text:s text:c="2"/>spaced and non-breaking‑hyphen.</text:p></office:text></office:body></office:document>
